  "notes": [
    "**Parecer** is an -ER verb with irregular \"yo\" form in present",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (parezco) with spelling change c→zc before o",
    "Preterite: regular -ER endings",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern",
    "Often used with indirect object pronouns: *me parece* (it seems to me)",
    "Reflexive form **parecerse a**: to look like, to resemble",
    "Common usage: *Parece difícil* (It seems difficult), *Te pareces a tu madre* (You look like your mother)"
